{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="card" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="muted">Working draft — to be finalized before public launch (see LAUNCH.md). Not yet reviewed by a lawyer; the operator accepts these on their own behalf.</p>

  <h3>The service</h3>
  <p>{{ brand }} runs automated accessibility checks against websites you tell it to scan and
  produces reports based on those checks. You may only scan websites you own or are authorized
  to test by their owner. We may suspend accounts that scan sites without authorization or
  attempt to abuse the crawler.</p>

  <h3>No compliance guarantee, no legal advice</h3>
  <p>Reports reflect automated checks only, which detect a subset of accessibility issues.
  {{ brand }} does not certify compliance with the ADA, the European Accessibility Act, WCAG,
  or any other standard or law, and nothing in the service is legal advice.</p>

  <h3>Billing and refunds</h3>
  <p>Subscriptions renew monthly until canceled, which you can do anytime from the billing
  portal. If the service didn't work for you, email {{ supportEmail }} within 30 days of a
  charge and we'll refund it.</p>

  <h3>Your data</h3>
  <p>You keep ownership of your data. Delete a site or your account and the associated data is
  removed immediately. See the <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h3>Liability</h3>
  <p>The service is provided as-is. To the maximum extent permitted by law, our total
  liability is capped at the amount you paid in the 3 months before the claim.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p><a href="mailto:{{ supportEmail }}">{{ supportEmail }}</a></p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
